# -- Swapping and Duplicating -- #

# puts 1 2 3 onto the stack, then swaps resulting in 1 3 2
1 2 3 swap
puts

# popping the top of the stack and swapping again leaves us with 3 1
.
swap
puts

# and finally with just 3
.
puts

# duplicating does just what you think it would, duplicate the top of the stack
42 dup puts . puts
